#. en: Hmmm...
msgctxt "4173:9"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#. en: Hey! Ummm...
msgctxt "4173:17"
msgid "Oye..."
msgstr ""

#. en: Whoa, it’s like a jungle!
