msgid "Espérameee..."
msgstr ""

#. en: Hmmm... Looks like I can’t get by here.
msgctxt "4173:91"
msgid "No puedo seguir por aquí..."
msgstr ""

#. en: It’s my turn, huh? I’ll do my best!
